BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Maurer School of Law
DTSTART:20261026T160000Z
DTEND:20261026T170000Z
LOCATION:Lowell E. Baier Hall - Lecture Room - 125
GEO:39.165074;-86.526424
SUMMARY:So… Who Gets Grandma's House? And Other Horror Stories: Estate 
 Planning in Practice
DESCRIPTION:Join the Real Estate and Estate Planning Association (REEPA) 
 for an engaging introduction to estate planning with attorneys E. Paige F
 reitag and Erin M. Martoglio from Freitag &amp\; Martoglio. We'll explore
  the basics of wills\, trusts\, probate\, powers of attorney\, and more\,
  while discussing what estate planning really looks like in practice.  Al
 ong the way\, we'll share real-world challenges\, unexpected complication
 s\, and a few "horror stories" from practice that illustrate what can hap
 pen when estate plans don't go as expected.  Whether you're new to estate
  planning or simply curious about where law\, family\, money\, and death 
 intersect\, this is a chance to see the fascinating\, sometimes dramatic\
 , and surprisingly juicy world of estate planning firsthand. Lunch will b
 e provided!
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join the Real Estate and Estate Plannin
 g Association (REEPA) for an engaging introduction to estate planning wit
 h attorneys E. Paige Freitag and Erin M. Martoglio from Freitag &amp\; Ma
 rtoglio. We'll explore the basics of wills\, trusts\, probate\, powers of
  attorney\, and more\, while discussing what estate planning really looks
  like in practice.<br /><br />  Along the way\, we'll share real-world ch
 allenges\, unexpected complications\, and a few "horror stories" from pra
 ctice that illustrate what can happen when estate plans don't go as expec
 ted.<br /><br />  Whether you're new to estate planning or simply curious
  about where law\, family\, money\, and death intersect\, this is a chanc
 e to see the fascinating\, sometimes dramatic\, and surprisingly juicy wo
 rld of estate planning firsthand. Lunch will be provided!</p>
UID:20261026T160000Z-2421297@events.iu.edu
DTSTAMP:20260917T130400Z
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2421297-so-who-gets-grandmas-house
 -and-other-horror
CATEGORIES:Student-run
LAST-MODIFIED:20260917T171232Z
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:2421297
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  Elly Slevin<br />\n  Real Estate &amp\; E
 state Planning Association\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-TAGS:Real Estate and Estate Planning Association
END:VEVENT
