 e Sanders\, and current Maurer clerks for a discussion of career opportun
 ities in the judiciary - summer internships\, term-limited post-grad cler
 kships\, and other longer term positions in the judiciary are great oppor
 tunities for lawyers. We will discuss what these opportunities are and ho
 w Maurer students can access them.<br />\n<br />\nLunch will be provided 
 to those who RSVP through CareerNet.</p>
