SUMMARY:Trick or Treat at Maurer
DESCRIPTION:Trick or Treat at Maurer is an event that brings together sta
 ff\, faculty\, and students with children to celebrate Halloween. Differe
 nt departments in the law school will decorate and have candy available f
 or the children that attend. This event will be hosted by OWLS and OLL.  
 To participate\, please RSVP below by October 27 with your name and the n
 umber of children accompanying you.  Those that would like to distribute 
 candy during the event should complete this brief form (https://docs.goog
 le.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSddXwxNyVSwmfmNucbTRe5P5mCkZIRcoGka9TxVzHZSJWqDig
 /viewform?pli=1) by Monday\, October 26 at noon. Only one submission per 
 office suite\, please (if entire suite is participating).  Organizers wil
 l provide a map of participating room numbers to children and families up
 on arrival.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Trick or Treat at Maurer is an event th
 at brings together staff\, faculty\, and students with children to celebr
 ate Halloween. Different departments in the law school will decorate and 
 have candy available for the children that attend. This event will be hos
 ted by OWLS and OLL.</p><p>  To participate\, please RSVP below by Octobe
 r 27 with your name and the number of children accompanying you.</p><p>  
 Those that would like to distribute candy during the event should <a href
 ="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSddXwxNyVSwmfmNucbTRe5P5mCkZIR
 coGka9TxVzHZSJWqDig/viewform?pli=1">complete this brief form</a> by Monda
 y\, October 26 at noon. Only one submission per office suite\, please (if
  entire suite is participating).</p><p>  Organizers will provide a map of
  participating room numbers to children and families upon arrival.</p>
