SUMMARY:Maurer School of Law\, SBA\, & Habitat for Humanity Build Day
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in providing affordable housing to familie
 s in need? Join the IU Maurer and Habitat of Humanity of Monroe County bu
 ild day on October 30th! This build day is open to everyone in the legal 
 community and their loved ones. We'd love to have you join us! To registe
 r\, select "Become a Builder (https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.
 com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgive.monroecountyhabitat.org%2Fcampaign%2F2026-iu-
 maurer-school-of-law%2Fc798107&amp\;data=05%7C02%7Ccafitzwa%40iu.edu%7C06
 2d600e3d3545ef14eb08df3068d970%7C1113be34aed14d00ab4bcdd02510be91%7C1%7C0
 %7C639282899026036140%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlY
 iOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%
 7C%7C&amp\;sdata=kYUH23eHQb0egVoX3kwNJEbaKXkj3e2ZgSZrs5Z%2Fj3k%3D&amp\;re
 served=0)" and fill out the registration information.&#160\;You don't nee
 d construction experience. Habitat provides the guidance and tools.&#160\
 ;Since we are raising the funds for the building materials\, participants
  are asked to raise $300. Members of the legal community have offered to 
 sponsor law school student builders and help them reach their fundraising
  goals. If you are a student at Maurer School of Law\, you can indicate o
 n the form that you are a student and that you would like assistance reac
 hing your fundraising goal.&#160\;Here is what to expect:Arrive at the bu
 ild site between 8am—8:20 a.m.8:30 a.m. — Morning circle and building
  instructions.Noon — Lunch provided by Habitat for Humanity4:00 p.m. �
 � Finish building! If you need to leave early\, please let a construction
  site manager know.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><span style="color: #0d0d0d\;">Are you in
 terested in providing affordable housing to families in need? Join the IU
  Maurer and Habitat of Humanity of Monroe County build day on October 30<
 sup>th</sup>! This build day is open to everyone in the legal community a
 nd their loved ones. We'd love to have you join us! To register\, select 
 "<a href="https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F
 %2Fgive.monroecountyhabitat.org%2Fcampaign%2F2026-iu-maurer-school-of-law
 %2Fc798107&amp\;data=05%7C02%7Ccafitzwa%40iu.edu%7C062d600e3d3545ef14eb08
 df3068d970%7C1113be34aed14d00ab4bcdd02510be91%7C1%7C0%7C63928289902603614
 0%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlA
 iOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp\;sdata=kYU
 H23eHQb0egVoX3kwNJEbaKXkj3e2ZgSZrs5Z%2Fj3k%3D&amp\;reserved=0">Become a B
 uilder</a>" and fill out the registration information.&#160\;</span></p><
 p><span style="color: #0d0d0d\;">You don't need construction experience. 
 Habitat provides the guidance and tools.&#160\;</span></p><p><span style=
 "color: #0d0d0d\;">Since we are raising the funds for the building materi
 als\, participants are asked to raise $300. Members of the legal communit
 y have offered to sponsor law school student builders and help them reach
  their fundraising goals. If you are a student at Maurer School of Law\, 
 you can indicate on the form that you are a student and that you would li
 ke assistance reaching your fundraising goal.&#160\;</span></p><p><span s
 tyle="color: #222222\;">Here is what to expect:</span></p><ul><li><span s
 tyle="color: #222222\;">Arrive at the build site between <strong>8am—8:
 20 a.m.</strong></span></li><li><span style="color: #222222\;"><strong>8:
 30 a.m.</strong> — Morning circle and building instructions.</span></li
 ><li><span style="color: #222222\;"><strong>Noon</strong> — Lunch provi
 ded by Habitat for Humanity</span></li><li><span style="color: #222222\;"
 ><strong>4:00 p.m.</strong> — Finish building! If you need to leave ear
 ly\, please let a construction site manager know.</span></li></ul>
UID:20261030T121500Z-2460649@events.iu.edu
DTSTAMP:20261022T171008Z
