BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Maurer School of Law
DTSTART:20261030T210000Z
DTEND:20261030T230000Z
LOCATION:Karst Farm Park
SUMMARY:2026 Socctoberfest
DESCRIPTION:Socctoberfest\, an annual co-ed round-robin tournament for Ma
 urer students\, celebrates its 23rd year at the law school. Four teams wi
 ll play six games to determine an overall winner. At the end of the night
 \, the winning team will receive a trophy that will be placed in the trop
 hy cabinet on the first floor of Baier Hall\, alongside the team photo\, 
 until the next tournament JD\, graduate\, and exchange students of all ab
 ility levels are welcome to participate.  Faculty\, staff\, students\, fr
 iends\, and family are welcome to attend. Bring a blanket or lawn chair i
 f you wish to watch the games!  Students interested in playing should com
 plete this registration form (https://iu.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_0e
 wMmJN7lq47MXk) by Friday\, October 23rd at 12:00 pm EST to participate. S
 pectators do not need to RSVP to attend.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Socctoberfest\, an annual co-ed round-r
 obin tournament for Maurer students\, celebrates its 23rd year at the law
  school. Four teams will play six games to determine an overall winner. A
 t the end of the night\, the winning team will receive a trophy that will
  be placed in the trophy cabinet on the first floor of Baier Hall\, along
 side the team photo\, until the next tournament JD\, graduate\, and excha
 nge students of all ability levels are welcome to participate.</p><p>  Fa
 culty\, staff\, students\, friends\, and family are welcome to attend. Br
 ing a blanket or lawn chair if you wish to watch the games!</p><p>  Stude
 nts interested in playing should complete <a href="https://iu.co1.qualtri
 cs.com/jfe/form/SV_0ewMmJN7lq47MXk">this registration form</a> by Friday\
 , October 23rd at 12:00 pm EST to participate. Spectators do not need to 
 RSVP to attend.</p>
UID:20261030T210000Z-2403574@events.iu.edu
DTSTAMP:20260901T140027Z
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2403574-2026-socctoberfest
